; scalingsocials.com: all 28 DNS records, pulled 2026-09-17 straight from the
; authoritative nameserver (ns-cloud-c1.googledomains.com), which is what
; Squarespace serves. Squarespace has no zone export, so this file is the export.
;
; Import: Cloudflare -> scalingsocials.com -> DNS -> Records -> Import and Export
;         -> Import DNS records -> choose this file -> UNTICK "Proxy imported
;         DNS records" (mail, DKIM and the Lovable apps must stay DNS-only).
;
; The @ and www A records still point at Hostinger on purpose: the site keeps
; working the moment nameservers flip. Pages replaces them when the custom
; domains are attached (runbook Step 5a).
;
;   Web (Hostinger, until cutover) ...... @, www
;   Lovable apps ......................... careers, crm, invoice + _lovable.* TXT
;   Google Workspace mail ................ MX x5, SPF, google._domainkey, _dmarc
;   Google site verification ............. yyla2z6wspxu CNAME
;   Mailgun .............................. mg MX x2, mg SPF, mx._domainkey.mg, email.mg
;   Resend / Amazon SES .................. resend._domainkey, send, send.updates
;   lemlist tracking ..................... trail CNAME
$ORIGIN scalingsocials.com.
@	1800	IN	A	193.203.185.224
www	1800	IN	A	193.203.185.224
careers	14400	IN	A	185.158.133.1
crm	14400	IN	A	185.158.133.1
invoice	14400	IN	A	185.158.133.1
